rText":"A young Sarkaz general, member of the Military Commission of Kazdel. After enlisting a large number of mercenaries in Londinium, he has assembled and trained a brand new type of fighting force. His Arts Unit 'Teekazwurtzen' was bestowed upon him by Theresis, the Regent of Kazdel, who also taught him the swordsmanship he now employs.","abilities":["Deals Arts damage with his floating cannon, attacks charge up Londinium Secondary Defense Artillery","[Military Training] Has high Physical and Arts dodge, but after being bombarded by the Defense Artillery, temporarily loses this dodge effect and is stunned for a period of time","First Form","[Focus] Continuously gains ASPD when attacking the same target (this effect is capped), resets when switching targets or not attacking for a few seconds","Second Form","[From Withered Trunk, New Branches] When defeated for the first time, randomly attacks all targets on the battlefield with his floating cannon, greatly accelerating the charge rate of Londinium Secondary Defense Artillery","In his second form, draws his sword alongside his floating cannon to perform simultaneous Physical and Arts attacks"],"levelCount":2,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":40000,"atk":1000,"def":600,"res":40,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":5}}},"dropIcons":{"3003":"/item-icons/pure_gold.png","4002":"/item-icons/originite_prime.png","30011":"/item-icons/orirock.png","30012":"/item-icons/orirock_cube.png","30013":"/item-icons/orirock_cluster.png","30061":"/item-icons/damaged_device.png","30062":"/item-icons/device.png","30063":"/item-icons/integrated_device.png","30073":"/item-icons/loxic_kohl.png","31013":"/item-icons/coagulating_gel.png","31053":"/item-icons/compound_cutting_fluid.png","31073":"/item-icons/fuscous_fiber.png"},"previewFile":"10-17_main_10-15.webp","emergency":null,"devices":[{"col":0,"description":null,"hidden":false,"key":"trap_058_gunctrl","kind":